## 1. Goal and Scope

**Goal:** make a first-time visitor (homeowner, developer, or commercial client) understand in 10 seconds that Fab Haus designs *and* builds, see proof of real work, and contact the studio without friction.

**Status:** Phase 1 is a **mock/preview build** for client approval. It runs on a temporary preview URL first and is connected to the client's GoDaddy domain only after sign-off (section 12). SEO is deferred (section 13).

**In scope (Phase 1):**
- One scrolling page that works on **all devices** (see "Device and browser compatibility" in section 6). Primary design targets are 1440px desktop and 390px mobile. Tablet, large-desktop and landscape layouts are also designed and tested.
- `mailto:` and WhatsApp contact.
- Outbound portfolio links (Architecture, Interiors) that open in a new tab.

**Out of scope (Phase 1):** login, dashboards, calculators, modals, multi-step forms, CMS, backend, SEO optimization (deferred, section 13).

**Phase 2 (separate, after launch):** conversational lead-qualifier. See section 11. It must not be added to Phase 1.

**Stack:** React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, GSAP + ScrollTrigger (via `@gsap/react`), Lenis (smooth scroll).

